  "proof_boundaries": [
    "Small mode has per-original one-copy authorization, not the ordinary percentage budget. Same aggregate cap is a native condition; repair policies are explicitly different.",
    "Exact expectations are prospective contract claims; any failure is retained. They are not generated from candidate output.",
    "Full source IDs, symbol membership, admission outcomes, loss actions, delivered/recovered/missing IDs and wire/HTTP byte ledgers must be emitted before assertions.",
    "The virtual test reports no echo RTT and no physical wire throughput. Native same-machine target one-way and echo RTT are measured separately."
  ]
